## Working on changes

{{WORKFLOW_GUIDANCE}}

Choose planning depth by scope, risk, compatibility, and reversibility. At a handoff, keep a checkpoint in the active spec or transfer it conversationally for a small task. Notes do not transfer uncommitted code; confirm the actual changes are available in the next checkout.
